# P5 TG-REDRAW: p5-toolgroup-retint's group in the full transcript (Ctrl-O)
# across a live theme switch, 256 colours. Drawn dark;
# Ctrl-O; the terminal reports light while the full transcript is open;
# Ctrl-O closes it onto the inline transcript, which the switch reached
# while it was hidden; then Ctrl-O again, dark, and closed.
fx: gateway p5-toolgroup-retint-fx.json
xfx: gateway p5-toolgroup-retint-xfx.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
wait 4
type run the command
wait 1
key Enter
wait 8
snap dark
key C-o
wait 2
snap full-dark
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 32 6e
wait 2
snap full-light
key C-o
wait 2
snap light
key C-o
wait 2
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 31 6e
wait 2
snap full-dark-again
key C-o
wait 2
snap dark-again
